abstract: >-
  A complete reserve transformation and compatible common capacity-price
  reductions give a certified bracket for the two-bidder, two-item
  independent-uniform randomized pointwise-DSIC auction. The explicit
  mechanism has an exact sixteen-face revenue expression enclosed between
  0.876514341027 and 0.876514355425. The unrestricted
  rational upper is below 0.8823515854887965762056, leaving a gap below
  0.005837245 and guaranteeing more than 99.3384% of optimal revenue.
  Zero-value exclusion proves pointwise admissibility of the global
  transformation. Enlarged conditional supports pay opposing virtual
  fields, while compatible two-way IC flows aggregate at shared cells.
  Exact continuous calculations distinguish measure reductions from
  numerical enclosure recovery. The unrestricted optimum and a matching
  mechanism remain open.
